{
  "//": "tools/ 下探针自己的类型检查配置，与主检查分开跑：tsc -p tools/tsconfig.json。为什么不并进主检查：① pi-surface-check.ts 的「故意报错」就是它的信号机制（断言 SDK 形态与预期不一致时主动失败），并进去会让主检查永远红；② rev/ 是只在本机的回归夹具，写法自由（allowImportingTsExtensions）。",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "lib": [
      "dom",
      "dom.iterable",
      "esnext"
    ],
    "strict": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "module": "esnext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "target": "ES2017",
    "types": [
      "node"
    ],
    "baseUrl": "..",
    "paths": {
      "@/*": [
        "./*"
      ]
    },
    "allowImportingTsExtensions": true
  },
  "include": [
    "./**/*.ts"
  ],
  "exclude": [
    "../node_modules",
    "../.next"
  ]
}
